WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.750
The editing workspace. The full manuscript, its revision marks and the saved conversation share one workspace.

00:00:06.750 --> 00:00:13.500
More than 50 proposed edits. At 10:25 a proposal covered eight source files. This edit keeps the proof outline in the main text and points readers to Appendix A for the details.

00:00:13.500 --> 00:00:20.250
Saved project changes. The 18:50 turn records 34 project changes. Its history links the task, proposed revisions and decisions.

00:00:20.250 --> 00:00:27.000
A changed passage. The seventh edit distinguishes a bound on sensory surprisal from a fixed rank cost. The app preserves the proposal and the later revision that resolved it.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:33.750
The source file’s history. The section has its own file history. Here it records saves by the author at 19:50 and 22:02.

00:00:33.750 --> 00:00:40.500
Building the arXiv package. The app repeats the package check on the saved manuscript. Its 11 files compile in an empty folder and reproduce the text on all 21 pages.
